Z||000000||geyser||01-25-2001||09:38 PM||||I've been toying with the idea of mounting an electrical radiator fan underneath one of the engine compartment vents. A 10" would fit nicely. Anyone tried this? Another question is to move air out of the engine compartment or into same?||||reg||5
